        "created_at": "2018-06-23T12:46:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, this post is a bit late, but I didn't want to post without being absolutely positive I fulfilled the conditions to the letter, and I've done so at least 10-15 times.</p><p>I attached a log as well. At first I thought it was something weird with the prerequisite games not being remembered or something, so I even did those two games before the game that the log was created from.</p><p>Is there something really obvious that I'm not doing correctly? This has been extremely frustrating, as locking down Progeny is simple with a certain setup, but it takes quite a while.</p>",
