        "created_at": "2018-06-25T22:37:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's hard to parse in log format, but did you have 6 ongoings in play at the same time?&nbsp; I counted 6 played altogether, but Sub-Zero Atmosphere was destroyed before all 5 others were played, if I counted correctly.</p><p>Have you unlocked any other members of the F5?&nbsp; That's the best test to make sure you're getting the prereq games.</p>",
